  "sentences": [
   {
    "sid": "s000",
    "kind": "intro",
    "text": "Good morning. Here are your AI stories for today, four of them in total.",
    "cites": [],
    "story_ref": null
   },
   {
    "sid": "s001",
    "kind": "intro",
    "text": "Let's begin with the big news.",
    "cites": [],
    "story_ref": null
   },
   {
    "sid": "s002",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "OpenAI has released Images 2.6, and ChatGPT can now create animated GIFs from a text prompt or an uploaded photo.",
    "cites": [
     "c1e68860d6535a2fe558042d22023122:0-253"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-4acfda106313"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s003",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Before this update, ChatGPT could not make a GIF in a single step.",
    "cites": [
     "c1e68860d6535a2fe558042d22023122:369-680"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-4acfda106313"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s004",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "You can adjust a GIF's animation speed and edit individual frames.",
    "cites": [
     "c1e68860d6535a2fe558042d22023122:0-253",
     "c1e68860d6535a2fe558042d22023122:369-680"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-4acfda106313"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s005",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "OpenAI says users now generate over 4 billion images per week, up from 3 billion in September.",
    "cites": [
     "c1e68860d6535a2fe558042d22023122:681-955"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-4acfda106313"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s006",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Images 2.6 is rolling out to all ChatGPT and Codex users on web, desktop, and mobile.",
    "cites": [
     "c1e68860d6535a2fe558042d22023122:956-1167"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-4acfda106313"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s007",
    "kind": "transition",
    "text": "Now, a story picked for you.",
    "cites": [],
    "story_ref": "ai-d1753883dbd0"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s008",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Moonshot AI has released the weights for Kimi K3.1 Pro on Hugging Face.",
    "cites": [
     "f4a904d03d800a16a7770eb45e6294e1:31-143"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-d1753883dbd0"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s009",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "It is an open-weight, natively multimodal agentic model, and the company calls it its most capable 3T-class model to date.",
    "cites": [
     "f4a904d03d800a16a7770eb45e6294e1:31-143"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-d1753883dbd0"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s010",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "It has a 1-million-token context window.",
    "cites": [
     "f4a904d03d800a16a7770eb45e6294e1:297-477"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-d1753883dbd0"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s011",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Compared with Kimi K3, it swaps full-attention layers for Gated DeepSeek Sparse Attention layers, for more efficient long-context work.",
    "cites": [
     "f4a904d03d800a16a7770eb45e6294e1:478-647"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-d1753883dbd0"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s012",
    "kind": "transition",
    "text": "Another story picked for you.",
    "cites": [],
    "story_ref": "ai-5449d0bd4d43"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s013",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Ricursive Intelligence has published a preview of Ripple-65B, a general-purpose model.",
    "cites": [
     "24ed9ebcee3dd33c584ac388a8b4bb15:455-672"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-5449d0bd4d43"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s014",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "The company says it scores 80.52 on TerminalBench 2.1, which it reports as the top result for U.S. open-weight models.",
    "cites": [
     "24ed9ebcee3dd33c584ac388a8b4bb15:673-1016"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-5449d0bd4d43"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s015",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Ricursive estimates development cost was 32 million dollars, about one-tenth of the previous open-weight leader on agentic coding.",
    "cites": [
     "24ed9ebcee3dd33c584ac388a8b4bb15:1823-2263"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-5449d0bd4d43"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s016",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "Sources say China's metal export curbs are disrupting supplies of micro drill bits used in the AI chip supply chain.",
    "cites": [
     "9e77dcebd729cf1cd42bcf2e121a2a03:344-595"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-96c4a5c335fd"
   },
   {
    "sid": "s017",
    "kind": "story",
    "text": "The disruption is one example of geopolitical tensions rippling through the global tech industry.",
    "cites": [
     "9e77dcebd729cf1cd42bcf2e121a2a03:344-595"
    ],
    "story_ref": "ai-96c4a5c335fd"
